# The Abyss's acid vent pool (content 11-04): CIPlay the_abyss_acid, in a test world 'CI ...'. The pool lies on a
# low shelf on the lagoon side of the lava tube's path (recipe 79.5 13). Run it under CIGapsWatchHealth: without the
# suit (CIGapsSuit off) the watch takes damage and the burn message shows; the suit run is the_abyss_acidsuit.
island The Abyss keep
offset -1.0393 0.1205
hour 11
weather Calm
at 79.5 13
wait 5
expect message The vent water burns.
at 79.5 13
wait 4
# the way out: from the pool's middle up the shallow slope on the path's side, onto the path
walk 79.5 13 to 81.8 11.4 to 84.6 9.4 to 87 9 h=3
